    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W0330 = Swedish extension of W03 SNOMED CT 242402009 + place=sports facility +
        activity=sport/exercise. Target SNOMED CT 4053867 (242402009) is the Athena crosswalk target for
        the parent W03 (ICD10 45756245). The injury mechanism is identical; target subsumes the clinical
