        represented in OMOP via context tables (visit_occurrence/observation), not a different disorder
        concept. Broader because target drops the place/activity specificity; high tier because the
        parent crosswalk is verified and the relationship is a fine-grained one-level metadata
        expansion, not a clinical breadth mismatch.
        """
}
